  {
    "type": 19,
    "content": "Maximizing Samples: https://discord.com/channels/437797104786604034/1084953188647583819/1084953188647583819\n\nStamp discount is the Atom Collider one, adds more of a discount each day. For important stamps that need rarer materials (mostly Salts, Anvil materials, and rare drops), things that can't stack, or that you don't have enough Carry Capacity for, those are the stamps you want to use the Stamp Decreaser's effect on.\nWaiting too long between uses may mean you're neglecting your stamps, but high discounts mean cheap stamps. You can ignore it for stamps that use common materials.",
